<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>errors on Go 中文档集</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/goframe/v2/errors/</link><description>Recent content in errors on Go 中文档集</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 10 Oct 2024 15:07:50 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/go_docs/goframe/v2/errors/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>gerror</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/goframe/v2/errors/gerror/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 Mar 2024 17:51:03 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/goframe/v2/errors/gerror/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/gogf/gf/v2@v2.6.4/errors/gerror"&gt;https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/gogf/gf/v2@v2.6.4/errors/gerror&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package gerror provides rich functionalities to manipulate errors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	软件包 gerror 提供了丰富的功能来操作错误。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For maintainers, please very note that, this package is quite a basic package, which SHOULD NOT import extra packages except standard packages and internal packages, to avoid cycle imports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	对于维护者来说，请注意，这个包是一个非常基本的包，除了标准包和内部包之外，不应该导入额外的包，以避免循环导入。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>gcode</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/goframe/v2/errors/gcode/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 Mar 2024 17:50:56 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/goframe/v2/errors/gcode/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
